==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[mistake]] made during the process of [[typing]], especially one caused by a slip of the fingers.
# A [[mistake]] made during the process of [[typesetting]].

====Usage notes====
Often shortened to ''[[typo]]''.

